From 7c3d69ba055c986ec8cf7d1583eb290579644390 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:11:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Account service: keep publishing the conservative portfolio
 value while the only uncertainty is another strategy's just-adopted position

2026-11-21 16:40Z: the 5-minute lane's first fill made this service mark its
order state uncertain for one reconciliation cycle. The published portfolio
value was withheld for the same 22 s; the lane refused on the missing value,
cancelled its resting bid and held its first leg unquoted while UP went
0.41 -> 0.61.

The reconciliation now records what its uncertainty consists of. When that
is exactly: no incoherent book, no order of ours awaiting a terminal read,
no quarantined order, every disputed market in ANOTHER registered strategy's
series and no live order of ours there -- the value (venue buying power plus
guaranteed pairs, which an adopted net position cannot raise) is still
published and says so. This service's own submission gate is unchanged.
OFF unless L5_PUBLISH_VALUE_DURING_SIBLING_ADOPTION is exactly
OTHER_STRATEGY_POSITION_ONLY. 30 tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HTk927uH8zwpj6gLES92PF
